{"title":"Career Roadmap · Payments Analyst","role":"Payments Analyst","summary":"A Payments Analyst analyses and supports the systems, transactions, processes and performance involved in moving money between customers, merchants, banks, payment networks and financial institutions.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BBA FinTech graduate, this is a very strong direct career pathway because the role combines financial-services knowledge, payment operations, data analysis, technology and risk/compliance."},{"type":"p","text":"The role can exist across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"FinTech companies"},{"text":"Payment gateways"},{"text":"Payment aggregators"},{"text":"Card networks"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"Digital-wallet businesses"},{"text":"NBFCs"},{"text":"Merchant platforms"},{"text":"SaaS companies with embedded payments"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Career positioning","text":"A fresh graduate may enter as Payments Operations Analyst, Payments Analyst, Transaction Analyst, Payment Operations Executive, Reconciliation Analyst, Merchant Operations Analyst or FinTech Operations Analyst before moving into more specialised payments-analysis roles."}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Aspect","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree alignment"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Excellent"}],[{"text":"Entry level"},{"text":"Payments Analyst / Payments Operations Analyst"}],[{"text":"Core function"},{"text":"Payment operations + analytics"}],[{"text":"Industry"},{"text":"FinTech / Banking / E-commerce"}],[{"text":"Analytical intensity"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Technology intensity"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Finance knowledge"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"SQL importance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Excel importance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Python importance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"PG requirement"},{"text":"Not mandatory"}],[{"text":"Long-term potential"},{"text":"High"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Payments Analyst Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Payments Analyst investigates and improves the movement of financial transactions."},{"type":"p","text":"A simplified payment lifecycle is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer"},{"type":"h","text":"Merchant"},{"type":"h","text":"Payment Gateway / Payment Processor"},{"type":"h","text":"Payment Network / Banking Infrastructure"},{"type":"h","text":"Issuer / Acquirer"},{"type":"h","text":"Authorization"},{"type":"h","text":"Capture"},{"type":"h","text":"Settlement"},{"type":"h","text":"Reconciliation"},{"type":"h","text":"Merchant/Customer Account"},{"type":"p","text":"A Payments Analyst helps make sure this process is:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Successful"},{"text":"Accurate"},{"text":"Secure"},{"text":"Cost-efficient"},{"text":"Compliant"},{"text":"Reliable"},{"text":"Fast"}]}]},{"heading":"Types of Payments You Should Understand","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Card payments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Credit cards"},{"text":"Debit cards"},{"text":"Prepaid cards"},{"text":"Card authorization"},{"text":"Capture"},{"text":"Refund"},{"text":"Chargeback"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Account-to-account payments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bank transfers"},{"text":"Instant payment systems"},{"text":"Real-time payments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital payments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mobile wallets"},{"text":"QR payments"},{"text":"Digital banking"},{"text":"Payment links"},{"text":"Embedded payments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Merchant payments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Online checkout"},{"text":"Point-of-sale payments"},{"text":"Payment gateway transactions"},{"text":"Recurring payments"},{"text":"Subscription payments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cross-border payments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Foreign currency"},{"text":"International settlements"},{"text":"FX"},{"text":"Correspondent banking"},{"text":"Cross-border fees"},{"text":"Compliance"}]}]},{"heading":"Important Payments Concepts","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BBA FinTech student should understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Authorization"},{"type":"p","text":"The transaction is checked and approved or declined by the relevant payment infrastructure."},{"type":"h","text":"Capture"},{"type":"p","text":"The approved transaction is submitted for completion."},{"type":"h","text":"Settlement"},{"type":"p","text":"Funds are transferred between the relevant parties."},{"type":"h","text":"Reconciliation"},{"type":"p","text":"Transaction records from different systems are compared to ensure they match."},{"type":"h","text":"Refund"},{"type":"p","text":"Money is returned to the customer."},{"type":"h","text":"Chargeback"},{"type":"p","text":"A card transaction is disputed through the relevant card-payment process."},{"type":"h","text":"Payment Failure"},{"type":"p","text":"A transaction does not complete successfully."},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst investigates why the failure happened."}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During the Degree","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Finance + Technology Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Financial management"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Management"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking fundamentals"},{"text":"Financial institutions"},{"text":"Interest"},{"text":"Credit"},{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Working capital"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer fundamentals"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Basic programming"},{"text":"Internet fundamentals"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — FinTech + Payments","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Financial technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital banking"},{"text":"Digital wallets"},{"text":"Payment gateways"},{"text":"Payment processors"},{"text":"Card payments"},{"text":"Open banking"},{"text":"Embedded finance"},{"text":"Banking APIs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Payment ecosystem"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the roles of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer"},{"text":"Merchant"},{"text":"Issuer"},{"text":"Acquirer"},{"text":"Payment gateway"},{"text":"Payment processor"},{"text":"Payment network"},{"text":"Bank"},{"text":"FinTech"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Become Job Ready","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Focus heavily on analytics."},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"PivotTables"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"This should become one of your strongest technical skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"Aggregations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Payments Analyst may need SQL to investigate millions of transaction records."}]},{"heading":"Python for Payments Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Python is not always mandatory for entry-level payments roles, but it provides a significant advantage."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python fundamentals"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data aggregation"},{"text":"CSV/Excel processing"},{"text":"API basics"},{"text":"Basic statistical analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Python for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transaction analysis"},{"text":"Failure-rate analysis"},{"text":"Fraud-pattern exploration"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"Settlement analysis"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills","Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"1"},{"text":"Finance + technology"},{"text":"Accounting, economics, Excel"},{"text":"Digital payments report"}],[{"text":"2"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Payment ecosystem + banking"},{"text":"Payment lifecycle project"}],[{"text":"3"},{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + Python + Power BI"},{"text":"Transaction analytics dashboard"}],[{"text":"4"},{"text":"Professionalisation"},{"text":"Risk + reconciliation + APIs"},{"text":"Internship + capstone"}],[{"text":"Graduation"},{"text":"Employment"},{"text":"Portfolio + interviews"},{"text":"Payments Analyst / Ops Analyst"}]]}]},{"heading":"Payments Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong candidate should be able to answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Why did payment success rate fall this week?\""},{"type":"p","text":"Investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Payment method"},{"text":"Bank"},{"text":"Merchant"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Device"},{"text":"Time"},{"text":"Error code"},{"text":"Transaction amount"},{"text":"Gateway"},{"text":"Network"},{"text":"Customer segment"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then identify the root cause."}]},{"heading":"Important Payments KPIs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Payment Success Rate"},{"type":"h","text":"Successful transactions ÷ total payment attempts"},{"type":"h","text":"Failure Rate"},{"type":"h","text":"Failed transactions ÷ total attempts"},{"type":"h","text":"Authorization Rate"},{"type":"p","text":"Percentage of attempted transactions successfully authorised."},{"type":"h","text":"Approval Rate"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for understanding transaction approval performance."},{"type":"h","text":"Refund Rate"},{"type":"p","text":"Percentage/value of transactions subsequently refunded."},{"type":"h","text":"Chargeback Rate"},{"type":"p","text":"Rate of transactions disputed through chargeback processes."},{"type":"h","text":"Average Transaction Value"},{"type":"h","text":"Total transaction value ÷ number of transactions"},{"type":"h","text":"Transaction Volume"},{"type":"p","text":"Number of payment transactions."},{"type":"h","text":"Payment Value"},{"type":"p","text":"Total monetary value processed."},{"type":"h","text":"Settlement Time"},{"type":"p","text":"Time taken for funds to reach the relevant account."}]},{"heading":"Reconciliation Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most valuable entry-level payment skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Imagine:"},{"type":"h","text":"Gateway records"},{"type":"p","text":"₹10,00,000"},{"type":"h","text":"Bank records"},{"type":"p","text":"₹9,98,500"},{"type":"h","text":"Merchant records"},{"type":"p","text":"₹10,00,000"},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst must investigate the ₹1,500 difference."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible reasons include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Failed settlement"},{"text":"Refund"},{"text":"Chargeback"},{"text":"Fee"},{"text":"Duplicate transaction"},{"text":"Missing transaction"},{"text":"Timing difference"},{"text":"Settlement adjustment"},{"text":"Data error"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Transaction Matching","Exception Identification","Root Cause","Resolution","Reporting"]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Payment Success Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a Power BI dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"